      <profiles>
        <profile name="Sentinel Protocols" id="bb94-8efd-1ea9-69f9" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After a Move Roll made for this unit during its Move step, you may discard the highest result of that Move Roll. If you do, skip this turn&apos;s Attacks step. Then, until the end of the battle round, after any enemy unit&apos;s Move step, as a reaction, this unit may make attacks targeting that unit (if able). If you do, you cannot do so again this battle round.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Doomstalker Subroutines" id="2721-0e6f-66ee-5103" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit is Activated, select one of the following abilities. This unit gains the selected ability until the next time it is Activated:

ANNIHILATE: For each attack made for this unit’s Doomsday Blaster, the Wound Roll for that attack is improved by 1

RELOCATE: You may reroll Move Rolls made for this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntries>
