    <selectionEntry name="Relics (Reference)" id="85c5-2a98-6852-6b1c" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="-2" type="upgrade">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Configuration" id="408b-e710-9812-13a7" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="9cd6-0442-3f35-6b52"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="59d1-9283-7001-2110" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Indirect" id="11c0-ccde-4e20-10c9" hidden="false" targetId="4de2-ca68-9af9-1b10" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink name="Ignore Cover" id="51d1-dccb-fc73-2962" hidden="false" targetId="c88b-5cb0-aa9d-b742" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink name="Resilient (X)" id="83b5-ba11-a4b9-c6dd" hidden="false" targetId="253c-c1fa-d29d-d21e" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="1. Oracular Optics" id="4c7c-4e4f-3f66-25eb" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">Each of this unit&apos;s ranged weapons gains Indirect and for each attack this unit makes, add 1 to the Hit Roll of that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2. Necrodermis Plating" id="5d35-8354-882a-0611" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">For each roll for this unit’s Living Metal, add D3 to that roll. Additionally, after a model in this unit loses Health, this unit may use ‘nanoscarab secretion’. If it does, it uses Living Metal and cannot use nanoscarab secretion again this battle round.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="3. Resurrection Ankh" id="f7c7-6447-4afb-ab4d" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit&apos;s move step, each friendly Necrons unit within 12&quot; of it may use Living Metal.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="4. Stormfield" id="6bf9-ec16-e1f3-bdd6" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">This unit gains Fly. If it already has Fly, add 1 D6 to Move Rolls made for this unit. After this unit&apos;s Move step, select up to three different enemy units within 12&quot;. Each selected unit suffers D3+2 SW.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="5. Hypernova Sceptre" id="88fb-591d-30ca-6671" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit&apos;s Move step, select a point on the battlefield edge and draw a line between that point and this unit. All enemy units that line crosses over which are visible to this unit suffer 3+D3 SW.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="6. Mandate of Reclaimance" id="79fe-64bf-7cb0-3c1d" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit is Activated in the battlefield, you may select any of your ready units. If that unit is on the battlefield, remove it and place it into reserves. Then, Deploy that unit wholly within 6&quot; of this unit. Then, this unit and the selected unit gain the following ability until the End step of the next turn:


Royal Reclaimers: For each attack made by this unit, a Hit Roll of 6 causes an additional hit. After this unit&apos;s turn, if you have another ready unit with Royal Reclaimers, take another turn, and you must select that unit to Activate that turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
  </selectionEntries>
  <sharedProfiles>
    <profile name="Relentless March" id="0126-6cc7-c58a-5e6b" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">Move Rolls made for this unit are 2D3 instead of 2D6.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Dimensional Oubliette" id="0854-5237-1342-0789" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit is Activated in reserves, you may Deploy it anywhere in the battlefield outside of engagement range of enemy models. If you do, during this turn&apos;s Move step, do not make a Move roll and this unit cannot Advance or Reposition.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Sentient Arcing" id="592c-3bb3-3093-ce73" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After selecting the target for this unit&apos;s Tesla Cannon or Twin Tesla Destructor, select up to one different enemy unit within 6&quot; of and visible to the selected target. Also make attacks with that weapon targeting each of the selected units.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
  </sharedProfiles>
  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Gauss" id="b2e9-8420-cfb7-4bde" hidden="false">
      <description>For each attack made for this weapon, the Wound Roll for that attack is improved by 1 and the Saving Throw for that attack is worsened by 1.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
