            <profile name="Madness Virus" id="aa60-08c5-3d8d-807a" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">Once per battle, after this unit is Activated, you may&apos;inject madness virus&apos;. If you do, until the End step, for each attack this unit makes this turn, that attack suffers a -1 to its Hit Roll and gains Critical Hits 5+.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Plasmacyte Construct" id="32f1-46d4-296c-a6b7" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">This unit&apos;s CANOPTEK PLASM ACYTE model cannot be selected to suffer wounds. After the last non-CANOPTEK PLASM ACYTE model dies, this unit&apos;s CANOPTEK PLASM ACYTE model dies.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
